  "title": "Pork Chops and Scalloped Potatoes",
  "description": "This is the greatest recipe I was ever given. It is a family favorite for us. Simple yet delicious pork chops and scalloped potatoes baked with chicken broth and a hint of paprika.",
  "authors": [
    "JAMON0126"
  ],
